@Nexum.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5019


### CalculatePenalty: Standard Daily Penalty
POST {{Nexum.Server_HostAddress}}/Penalty/CalculatePenalty
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "UserId": 1,
  "PenaltyPolicyID": 1,
  "ActiveStatus": "Active",
  "OutstandingBalance": 5000.00,
  "DueDate": "2024-09-30T00:00:00",
  "PaymentAmount": 0.00
}

